{"c":"411057","n":"LABE 25","t":"M","s":"STČ","o":"Týnec nad Labem","url":"411057-labe-25","stav":"2026-10-08","popis":"Od jezu ve Veletově až ke vtoku Černé struhy do Labe na ř. km 935,9. Součástí revíru jsou odstavná ramena ve Veletově, Týnci nad Labem a Černá struha. Lov z plavidel je na celém revíru zakázán. Ponecháním dvou vyjmenovaných ryb, uvedených v § 16 odst. 2 vyhlášky č. 197/2004 Sb. v platném znění, končí denní lov ryb, i když nebylo dosaženo celkového denního limitu 7 kg ulovených ryb. Nejmenší lovná míra štiky je stanovena na 55 cm. Kapr nad 65 cm (včetně) se musí bez prodlení a s maximální šetrností vrátit zpět do rybářského revíru, kde byl uloven.","delka":6,"rozloha":48,"lat":50.124606,"lon":15.183879,"mo_web":"https://www.rybsvaz.cz/mo/-/tynec-nad-labem","mo_tel":"773 456 387","mo_mail":"rybaritynecnl@seznam.cz","doba":[{"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-12-31","h":"05:00–22:00","zakaz":false}],"kratkodobe":[],"miry":[{"d":"Amur bílý","min":50,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Bolen dravý","min":40,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Candát obecný","min":45,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Cejn velký","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Hlavatka obecná","min":65,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec jesen","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":true,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec tloušť","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jeseter malý","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Kapr obecný","min":40,"max":65,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Lín obecný","min":20,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Lipan podhorní","min":40,"max":null,"hajen"